{"title": "Verillius Receptor", "pageid": 52189, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Verillius_Receptor", "categories": ["Characters", "Fiends", "Mentioned characters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Verillius Receptor</b> is a <i>High Inquisitor</i> in service of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/38px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/50px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zariel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\">Zariel</a>, mentioned in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Verillius Receptor is a <a href=\"/wiki/Fiend\" title=\"Fiend\">Fiend</a> who works as a <i>High Inquisitor</i> in service of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/38px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/50px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zariel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png/25px-Portrait_Zariel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Portrait_Zariel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zariel\" title=\"Zariel\">Zariel</a>. She has official permission to audit Raphael's collection. Verillius' true form is so ghastly and mind-scarring that she takes on guises when she comes to visit. Although she never appears in the game, she is especially feared by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archivist\" title=\"Archivist\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Portrait_Archivist.png/25px-Portrait_Archivist.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Portrait_Archivist.png/38px-Portrait_Archivist.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Portrait_Archivist.png/50px-Portrait_Archivist.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Archivist\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Portrait_Archivist.png/25px-Portrait_Archivist.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Portrait_Archivist.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Archivist\" title=\"Archivist\">Archivist</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>. Thus, the player character can deceive the Archivist by introducing themselves as Verillius, saying they are acting as Zariel's High Inquisitor. Successfully doing so allows the party to stay in the Archive without triggering an alarm.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deal_with_the_Devil\" title=\"Deal with the Devil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deal with the Devil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Deal_with_the_Devil\" title=\"Deal with the Devil\">Deal with the Devil</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Escape_the_Deal\" title=\"Escape the Deal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Escape the Deal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Escape_the_Deal\" title=\"Escape the Deal\">Escape the Deal</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_Hope\" title=\"Save Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></pict